# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible (Issue #86).
#
# data/ matters most: the raw dataset is 6.2 GB, and without this the Docker daemon would
# receive all of it as build context on every build -- turning a ~1 minute build into a
# many-minute one, for files the serving path never reads.

data/
.venv/
venv/
notebooks/
tests/
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
mlflow.db
.git/
.github/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
